<mxCell id="i4-4" value="app&lt;br&gt;MapGroup(&quot;/account&quot;)&lt;br&gt;.MapIdentityApi&lt;br&gt;&amp;lt;IdentityUser&amp;gt;()" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=10;align=center;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="100" width="140" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
